{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47627","headline":"大云寺茶诗 · 吕岩","name":"大云寺茶诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉蘂一枪称绝品，僧家造法极功夫。\n兔毛瓯浅香云白，虾眼汤翻细浪俱。\n断送睡魔离几席，增添清气入肌肤。\n幽丛自落溪岩外，不肯移根入上都。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}